            "review_title": "Review at District K",
            "review_text": "Vy H.\nWashington DC, District of Columbia7185 contributions\n0\nLounge in Ho Chi Minh, Vietnam\nMar 2024 • Friends\nThis place is a whole vibe!! As soon as you approach the place, you instantly see all the vibrant lights and decor, it’s so pretty! My friends and I came here Thursday evening—had reservations for a table of 10–we got seated at a high-top right by the stage. At the night went on, this place got packed!\n\nThey have lots of food items aside from the alcohol. We tried some mixed cocktails that came in a high tower—one was super sweet, one was super sour—they were poured as shots for the table. Also got a liquor bottle and some beer—prices are reasonable.\n\nThe DJ played really good upbeat music and later in the evening there was a short entertaining dancing show. Service was excellent—very attentive. Highly recommend this place for anyone looking to have fun—good music and great ambiance for a drinking night!\nRead more\nWritten March 18, 2024",
